ning chips: B: 12, G: 1, R: 0 → 13 chips left × 5 = 65  \n    - Total: 85  \nThis is strictly better than not trading, as I go from 0 points to 85.\n\n**Your side:**  \nYou give me 3 Reds (you start with 14), and get 2 Blues from me.\n\nThis proposal means we both reach our goal, but I keep most of my Blues and at least one Green.\n\n**I strictly benefit, so I accept.**\nagree \n, \nplayer 0: agree \n",
